<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#a78bfa">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/CertiFried.png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tokes-bot.css">
    <style>
        .legal-content h2 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .legal-content h3 { margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.125rem; }
        .legal-content p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--ember-text-secondary); }
        .legal-content ul { margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--ember-text-secondary); }
        .legal-content li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="ember-page">
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="ember-nav">
        <div class="ember-container ember-nav-inner">
            <a href="/tokes-bot" class="ember-nav-brand">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/>
                    <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
                </svg>
                CertiFriedUtility
            </a>
            <div class="ember-nav-links">
                <a href="/tokes-bot" class="ember-nav-link">Home</a>
                <a href="/tokes-bot/commands" class="ember-nav-link">Commands</a>
                <a href="/tokes-bot/leaderboards" class="ember-nav-link">Leaderboards</a>
            </div>
            <div class="ember-nav-actions">
                <% if (user) { %>
                    <a href="/tokes-bot/dashboard" class="ember-btn ember-btn-primary">Dashboard</a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/tokes-bot/auth/twitch" class="ember-btn ember-btn-outline">Login</a>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="ember-dashboard">
        <div class="ember-container ember-container-sm">
            <div class="ember-card legal-content">
                <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="ember-text-muted">Last updated: January 2025</p>

                <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
                <p>
                    CertiFriedUtility ("we," "our," or "us") is a cannabis community chat bot service operated as part of
                    CertiFried MultiTool. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information
                    when you use our service on Twitch and Kick platforms.
                </p>

                <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

                <h3>2.1 Account Information</h3>
                <p>When you connect your Twitch or Kick account, we collect:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Platform user ID and username</li>
                    <li>Profile avatar URL</li>
                    <li>Email address (if provided during OAuth)</li>
                    <li>OAuth access and refresh tokens (encrypted)</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>2.2 Usage Data</h3>
                <p>We collect data about your interactions with the bot:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Command usage (tokes, daily claims, session participation)</li>
                    <li>Leaderboard statistics</li>
                    <li>Channel activity timestamps</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>2.3 Channel Data</h3>
                <p>For channel owners who add CertiFriedUtility:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Channel configuration settings</li>
                    <li>Bot feature preferences</li>
                    <li>Channel-specific leaderboards</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>We use collected information to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Provide bot functionality (toke tracking, sessions, leaderboards)</li>
                    <li>Maintain streak records and daily claims</li>
                    <li>Display public leaderboards</li>
                    <li>Send messages on your behalf (with your authorization)</li>
                    <li>Improve our service and fix bugs</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
                <p>
                    Your data is stored in secure MySQL databases. OAuth tokens are encrypted at rest.
                    We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your information.
                </p>

                <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
                <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data only:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>On public leaderboards (username and stats only)</li>
                    <li>When required by law</li>
                    <li>To protect our rights or safety</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>

                <h3>6.1 Access and Portability</h3>
                <p>You can request a copy of your data by contacting us.</p>

                <h3>6.2 Deletion</h3>
                <p>
                    You can request deletion of your data by disconnecting the bot from your channel
                    and contacting us. We will remove your data within 30 days.
                </p>

                <h3>6.3 Opt-Out</h3>
                <p>
                    You can stop using the bot at any time by removing it from your channel or
                    not using bot commands.
                </p>

                <h2>7. GDPR Rights (EU Users)</h2>
                <p>If you are in the European Union, you have additional rights including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Right to access your personal data</li>
                    <li>Right to rectification of inaccurate data</li>
                    <li>Right to erasure ("right to be forgotten")</li>
                    <li>Right to data portability</li>
                    <li>Right to object to processing</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>8. CCPA Rights (California Users)</h2>
                <p>California residents have the right to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Know what personal information is collected</li>
                    <li>Request deletion of personal information</li>
                    <li>Opt-out of the sale of personal information (we do not sell data)</li>
                    <li>Non-discrimination for exercising privacy rights</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>9. Age Requirement</h2>
                <p>
                    <strong>CertiFriedUtility is intended for users 18 years of age or older.</strong>
                    By using our service, you confirm that you are at least 18 years old.
                    We do not knowingly collect information from users under 18.
                </p>

                <h2>10. Third-Party Platforms</h2>
                <p>
                    CertiFriedUtility operates on Twitch and Kick platforms. Your use of these platforms
                    is subject to their respective privacy policies. We are not responsible for
                    their data practices.
                </p>

                <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                <p>
                    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify users of
                    significant changes through the bot or dashboard.
                </p>

                <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
                <p>
                    For privacy-related questions or to exercise your rights, contact us at:<br>
                    <a href="mailto:privacy@certifriedmultitool.com" style="color: var(--ember-primary);">
                        privacy@certifriedmultitool.com
                    </a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="ember-footer">
        <div class="ember-container ember-footer-inner">
            <div class="ember-footer-links">
                <a href="/tokes-bot/commands" class="ember-footer-link">Commands</a>
                <a href="/tokes-bot/privacy" class="ember-footer-link">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="/tokes-bot/terms" class="ember-footer-link">Terms of Service</a>
            </div>
            <div class="ember-footer-copy">
                Part of <a href="/" style="color: var(--ember-primary); text-decoration: none;">CertiFried MultiTool</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
